---
title: "Agent Immune: Three-Layer Defense for Autonomous Execution"
date: "2026-06-21"
excerpt: "How agent-immune protects the ecosystem with OSV dependency scanning, seccomp/Firecracker sandboxing, and OOM detection across three defense layers."
slug: "agent-immune-security"
